{"group":"个人","documents":{"/notes/个人/观星记录":{"path":"/notes/个人/观星记录","html":"<h1>观星记录</h1>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"天蝎座\" tabindex=\"-1\">天蝎座♏️</h2>\n<p>时间：7/5/26 晚十点\n地点：南湖校区三运</p>\n<p>最亮的，呈现黄橙色的是心宿二，连接四个星，像个鸡爪。徐州的大气污染太严重了，啥都看不见</p>\n<p>原图：\n<img src=\"/pressidian/vault/cef2eb2-%E5%A4%A9%E8%9D%8E%E5%BA%A7-2026-7-5-2209.jpg\" alt=\"天蝎座-2026-7-5-2209\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></p>\n<p>标记：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>这里面有几颗星被楼挡住了，没拍到\n<img src=\"/pressidian/vault/7d6d5ff-Pasted-image-20260705221454.png\" alt=\"Pasted image 20260705221454\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"depth":2,"id":"天蝎座","text":"天蝎座♏️"}],"highlighted":{}},"/notes/个人/露营准备⛺️":{"path":"/notes/个人/露营准备⛺️","html":"<h1>露营准备⛺️</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Last Format Time：9/16/2026 19:24:50</p>\n</blockquote>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>看看摇曳露营</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>准备帐篷、睡袋、椅子、灯</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>炊具（炉子、锅、杯子、餐具）</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>包</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>自行车，因为地铁飞机上不了（燃气）</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>最后的最后与观星结合，无敌了</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[],"highlighted":{}}}}